# pc64mp - TEST-ONLY configuration for the historical embedded-MicroPython
# regressions.  It is never the normal O boot path: the default pc64 kernel
# embeds oinit and kbdfs and loads MicroPython from O.  These gates still
# drive the inherited file/DMOBJ and raw GE/O probes through /boot/mp:
# tools/test-ge.sh, test-o-volume.sh, test-o-objects.sh, test-o-space.sh,
# test-mpinit.sh and test-space.sh.  Same devices as pc64.
